WEBVTT

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.000
E: Superstar.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.200
SW: Yeah. You are a superstar.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.000
(Laughter)

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.560
Well, we would like 
to encourage all of you

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:08.680
to do your part to help protect 
Einstein's animal friends,

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.860
and to do your part to help protect 
their homes that they live [in].

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.700
Now, Einstein does say it best 
when we ask her.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.270
Why do we want to protect your home?

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.000
E: I'm special.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.000
SW: You are very special.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.720
What would you like to say
to all these nice people?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.080
E: I love you.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.480
SW: That's good. 
Can you blow them a kiss?

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:23.000
E: [Kissing noise]

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.480
SW: And what do you say 
when it's time to go?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.750
E: Goodbye.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.240
SW: Good job. Thank you all.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:31.000
(Applause)